973
01:01:01,914 --> 01:01:04,074
年を取った現状に浸ってたんだよ
Immersed in the current state of growing older.

974
01:01:06,279 --> 01:01:07,229
大人ぶった作戦で
Playing grown-up with our strategies,

975
01:01:07,509 --> 01:01:10,009
不思議な合図立てて
Setting up mysterious signals.

976
01:01:10,249 --> 01:01:12,819
「行こうか、今日も戦争だ」
"Let's go, it's war today too,"

977
01:01:13,079 --> 01:01:15,629
立ち向かって 手を取った
We stood facing each other and took our hands.

978
01:01:17,487 --> 01:01:18,667
理不尽なんて当然で
Unreasonableness is only natural,

979
01:01:18,667 --> 01:01:21,147
独りぼっち 強いられて
Left alone, we were forced to be strong.

980
01:01:21,367 --> 01:01:24,567
迷った僕には憂鬱になりそうになってさ
Lost as I was, I felt like I'd turn gloomy.

981
01:01:27,067 --> 01:01:27,887
背高草を分けて
Parting the tall grass,

982
01:01:27,887 --> 01:01:30,427
滲む太陽睨んで
Swallowing the oozing sun,

983
01:01:30,587 --> 01:01:32,507
君はさ、こう言ったんだよ
You said this to me:

984
01:01:33,497 --> 01:01:36,657
「孤独だったら、おいでよ」
"If you're lonely, then come along!"

985
01:01:38,167 --> 01:01:40,017
騒がしさがノックして
The noise started to lock,

986
01:01:40,017 --> 01:01:42,597
生まれた感情さえも
Even feelings that were born inside,

987
01:01:42,757 --> 01:01:45,407
頭に浮かんでは萎んだ
Floating in my head and fading away.

988
01:01:45,794 --> 01:01:47,484
「幻なのかな?」
"Was it just an illusion?"

989
01:01:47,704 --> 01:01:50,154
秘密基地に集まって
Gathering in our secret base,

990
01:01:50,374 --> 01:01:53,174
「楽しいね」って単純なあの頃を思い出して
Remembering those simple days of "this is fun,"

991
01:01:53,404 --> 01:01:56,654
話をしよう
Let's have a talk.

992
01:01:58,478 --> 01:01:59,978
飛行機雲飛んで行って
Vapour trails flying across the sky,

993
01:02:00,198 --> 01:02:03,038
「眩しいね」って泣いていた
Crying, "It's so dazzling."

994
01:02:03,138 --> 01:02:05,248
君はどんな顔だっけ
What did your face look like back then?

995
01:02:05,718 --> 01:02:08,618
なぜだろう、思い出せないな
I wonder why, I just can't remember.

996
01:02:09,211 --> 01:02:11,081
痛いくらいに現実は
Reality was painful enough

997
01:02:11,331 --> 01:02:13,981
足早に駆け抜けた
To run through it ahead of time.

998
01:02:14,431 --> 01:02:16,911
選んだ今日は平易で
Choosing days that are ordinary,

999
01:02:17,011 --> 01:02:19,561
崩れそうになる日々さ
Yet days that feel like they're falling apart.

1000
01:02:40,161 --> 01:02:40,581
退屈街に現実は
With a tired reality like a farce,

1001
01:02:41,371 --> 01:02:44,301
足早に駆け抜けた
I ran through it as quick as I could.

1002
01:02:45,494 --> 01:02:47,484
選んだ今日は平穏で
Choosing days that were plain and calm,

1003
01:02:47,564 --> 01:02:50,354
かき乱されそうになる日々さ
Even my overflowing emotions turned sour.

1004
01:02:50,937 --> 01:02:53,207
昨日の今日も延長戦
Yesterday and today, another overtime battle,

1005
01:02:53,397 --> 01:02:56,337
大人だって臆病だ
Cowardly adults that we are.

1006
01:02:56,417 --> 01:02:59,297
今になってなんとなし
Now it somehow feels like

1007
01:02:58,837 --> 01:03:01,627
気付けたみたいだよ
I've finally realized it.

1008
01:03:01,477 --> 01:03:04,047
廻るセカイのアイデア
Revolving world of ideas,

1009
01:03:04,047 --> 01:03:07,507
枯れる太陽 炎天下
Fading sun, under the blazing sky,

1010
01:03:07,507 --> 01:03:10,007
陽炎が揺らいだ
The shimmering heat waves.

1011
01:03:10,119 --> 01:03:12,879
「忘れないで、さぁ、進もう」
"Don't forget, come on, let's move forward,"

1012
01:03:12,929 --> 01:03:15,999
もどかしさに何度も明日を夢見ていた
Dreaming of tomorrow over and over in frustration.

1013
01:03:16,989 --> 01:03:19,559
戻らない、先のある世界へ
Never going back, toward a future world,

1014
01:03:19,559 --> 01:03:22,159
「僕たちで変えよう」
"Let's change it ourselves."

1015
01:03:22,520 --> 01:03:25,170
「思い出して、終わったって。」
"Remember, it's all over now."

1016
01:03:25,360 --> 01:03:27,860
秘密基地も、冒険も
The secret base, the adventures,

1017
01:03:28,070 --> 01:03:31,160
あの日に迷い込んだ話の事も
And the story we got lost in that day.

1018
01:03:32,419 --> 01:03:34,209
独りぼっちが集まった
The strategy of the children

1019
01:03:34,709 --> 01:03:37,499
子どもたちの作戦が
Who gathered all alone,

1020
01:03:37,499 --> 01:03:40,019
また今日も繰り出した
Begins playing out once again today.

1021
01:03:40,498 --> 01:03:42,598
「また、何処かで。」
"Again, somewhere else."

1022
01:03:42,938 --> 01:03:45,488
「涼しいね」って言い合った
"It's refreshing, isn't it?" we agreed,

1023
01:03:45,488 --> 01:03:47,978
夏空は透明だ
The summer sky is transparent.

1024
01:03:47,978 --> 01:03:51,198
忘れないように吸い込んで
Breathing it in so we don't forget,

1025
01:03:51,198 --> 01:03:53,738
「さようならをしよう」
"Let's say goodbye."

1026
01:03:54,771 --> 01:03:57,271
秘密基地に集まって
Gathered at the secret base,

1027
01:03:57,271 --> 01:04:00,181
笑い合った夏の日々に
Smiling at each other on those summer days,

1028
01:04:00,181 --> 01:04:03,591
「また何処かで思い出して出逢えるかな」って
"I wonder if we can meet again somewhere and remember."

1029
01:04:03,591 --> 01:04:07,231
何度も描こう
Drawing it out over and over.

1030
01:05:00,104 --> 01:05:11,337
世界征服
World Domination

